  "description": "Nam Hee-Yeon has been having strange but steamy dreams with various men, from strangers to childhood friends! However, he doesn’t mind these vivid fantasies and wakes up feeling content every morning. One day, he encounters Seong-Jun, someone he thought had only existed in his dreams. From there, his life gets entangled with all the men he'd been dreaming about, including his cousin In-Hu, his childhood friend Ho-Yeon, and the mysterious Seok-Ju. Amidst all the chaos, can Hee-Yeon take control of his situation, or will it sweep him away?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n *Note: Chapter count includes 7 side story chapters.*",
